NAME
    diff - compare a snapshot against current memory

SYNOPSIS
    diff <name> [<count>]

DESCRIPTION
    Compares a snapshot saved with 'snapshot' against that same space's
    CURRENT contents and lists every byte address that's different now
    (default 20 shown). Doesn't touch or replace the saved snapshot, so the
    same baseline can be diffed again later against a further state.

EXAMPLES
    diff before
    diff before 50
